# Dependency-Aware Development
RULE: Check unified-trading-pm/workspace-manifest.json before adding/removing deps. Use --dep-branch when deps differ from main.
WHY: Quickmerge uses matrix for cascade; wrong order breaks CI.
CODEX: unified-trading-pm/workspace-manifest.json, .cursor/rules/always-use-quickmerge.mdc
DO: Consult matrix before changes; use --dep-branch for differential branching; merge dependency before consumer
NEVER: Change deps without matrix check; push consumer before dependency; skip cascade
